Scope

This license covers the Cosimo-authored code and documentation in this
repository: everything under kit/, the starter plugin and tests, and the root
files generated from the kit template. Code you add is yours. Third-party
software the build downloads or links (JUCE, Cmajor, CHOC, CPM.cmake, and the
npm packages named in package.json) is licensed by its own authors under the
terms listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and in each package.
